# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local `wrangler dev`. Never commit `.dev.vars`.
# SANDBOX_API_KEY: the sandbox SANDBOX_SDK_KEY (tenant-bound X-API-Key).
# SUPPLIER_PIN:    the sandbox device's KRA PIN (kept out of source — it is
